{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Think together. Move together. Meow together.</strong> \ud83d\udc3e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc31 Meow Mates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meow Mates</strong> is a minimalist 2D <strong>co-op multiplayer puzzle platformer</strong>. Solve timing-based puzzles, overcome challenging obstacles, and complete each level through real <strong>teamwork</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in <strong>multiplayer co-op</strong> with friends or experience the full adventure in fully balanced <strong>single-player</strong> mode. Every level focuses on coordination, reflexes, and smart strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 True Co-op Puzzle Platforming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a platformer with co-op added on top.<br>Meow Mates is a <strong>puzzle platformer built around cooperation</strong> from the ground up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simultaneous button mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lifting and positioning teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synchronized jumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing-based traps and moving hazards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level requires communication and coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae 40 Handcrafted Levels</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mechanics introduced over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming skills and puzzle-solving evolve together</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn.<br>Challenging to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Unlockable Cat Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to unlock new cat characters and customize your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Single-Player Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No teammate available?<br>All levels are fully playable in <strong>single-player</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Steam Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Trading Cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531450?t=1771011325","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531450/f51582e53f200cbbb116ee2749d1d952ad032226/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771011325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531450/445aac28094ea8439280f1870085cb0f27599620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771011325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531450/445aac28094ea8439280f1870085cb0f27599620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771011325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Think together. Move together. Meow together.</strong> \ud83d\udc3e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc31 Meow Mates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meow Mates</strong> is a minimalist 2D <strong>co-op multiplayer puzzle platformer</strong>. Solve timing-based puzzles, overcome challenging obstacles, and complete each level through real <strong>teamwork</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in <strong>multiplayer co-op</strong> with fri